{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2023-04-28 11:15:00', 'title': 'KROGER RECYCLES AND UPCYCLES ITS WAY TO LESS WASTE', 'text': "RECYCLING PROGRAM REACHES MILESTONE AND SIMPLE TRUTH®, AMERICA'S #1 NATURAL AND ORGANIC BRAND, ADDS UPCYCLED INGREDIENT BREAD TO PRODUCT LINEUP CINCINNATI , APRIL 28, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KROGER CO. (NYSE: KR) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS INNOVATIVE RECYCLING PROGRAM HAS HIT A MAJOR MILESTONE, RECYCLING MORE THAN ONE MILLION PIECES OF OUR BRANDS FLEXIBLE PLASTIC PRODUCT PACKAGING. THE COMPANY SHARED IT IS OFFERING CUSTOMERS MORE ITEMS WITH UPCYCLED INGREDIENTS WITH THE ADDITION OF TWO NEW SIMPLE TRUTH® PRODUCTS TO ADVANCE SUSTAINABILITY."}